            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.44.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 44.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Nji ejo Sairos olaiguanani le Parsia; Aaishoo nanu Olaitoriani, Enkai e keper, nkitoriat pooki enkop, naaitanapa ninye nanu pee ashetaki ninye enkaji te Yerusalem, te nkop e Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pooki ng'ae tiatua intae iltung'ana lenyena pooki, metaa Enkai enye tenebo ninye, naa nchoo ninye eilep alo Yerusalem, te nkop e Yuda, nelo ashet enkaji o Laitoriani, Enkai oo Siraeli ninye ilo otii Yerusalem; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa nchoo pooki tung'ani otelekua, te pooki wueji nemanya ninye, eretu ninye iltung'ana le manyisho enye te nkosholai o te sahabu, o too masaa o too ng'uesi, tenebo nena kishorot o lpela",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "lpela",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "nkishorot naaitayuni te nyorrata",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " tenkaraki ina aji e Nkai natii Yerusalem.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nedumunye ilukuny oo nkajijik oo loo menye te Yuda o te Benchamen, o lapolosak o Lawi, o pooki ng'ae otuputuo Olaitoriani oltau lenye pee eilep alo ashet ina aji o Laitoriani natii Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore lelo pooki oomanita ninche neretu ninche too masaa e nkosholai, o te sahabu, o too masaa, o too ng'uesi, o too ntokitin naagol enkinyiang'a tenebo nena pooki naaishoruaki to lpela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyau sii Sairos ilo aiguanani nena masaa enkaji o Laitoriani apa naawa Nebukadnesa te Yerusalem nelo apik atua enkaji oo nkaitin enyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyau Sairos olaiguanani le Parsia nena pooki eitasheiki Mitrehat ilo ashumani, laa ninye oikenaka ninye pooki Sheshbasa ilo kitok le Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ena apa esiana enye: ngirran enkalifu nabo e sahabu, o ngirran enkalifu nabo e nkosholai, nkalema tikitam ooudo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilbakulini tomoni uni le sahabu, o lbakulini nkalifuni are o iip ong'uan le nkosholai, o kulie masaa enkalifu nabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore imasaa pooki e sahabu o nenkosholai naa nkalifuni imiet o iip ong'uan o ntomoni ile o naaudo. Kuna pooki eyaua Sheshbasa ina kata pee eyauni ilootaarayioki metushukunye aaing'uaa Babilon nepuonu Yerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
